<view class="page page-with-action-bar">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">评分</view>
    <view class="stars">
      <text
        wx:for="{{starList}}"
        wx:key="value"
        class="star {{item.on ? 'star--on' : ''}}"
        bindtap="onStarTap"
        data-value="{{item.value}}"
      >{{item.char}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="text-muted">{{rating}} 分</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">评价内容</view>
    <textarea
      class="textarea"
      value="{{content}}"
      placeholder="说说这次购物体验(选填)"
      maxlength="500"
      bindinput="onContentInput"
    ></textarea>
  </view>

  <view class="card row-between">
    <text>匿名评价</text>
    <switch checked="{{anonymous}}" color="#FF4D1C" bindchange="onAnonymousChange" />
  </view>

  <view class="hint text-muted">
    暂不支持上传图片:后端目前没有文件上传接口。传本地路径没有意义,提交后另一端打不开。
  </view>
</view>

<view class="action-bar">
  <view class="action-bar__btn {{submitting ? 'action-bar__btn--off' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit">提交评价</view>
</view>
